WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.560
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:11.420
That <i>hurt</i>...!

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:11.820
Yuma.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:13.490
Huh?

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.950
This is for you.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.480
Huh? This is mine?

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.410
Yes. HQ has acknowledged your efforts.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:22.880
Heck yeah!

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.880
Keep your voice down.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.910
Didn't I tell you that this was our secret?

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:29.050
O-Oh, sorry.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:34.180
By the way, you're acquainted with Dr. Faker's son, Kaito, right?

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.680
Yeah, what about?

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:36.640
Look out!

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:50.480
Man, Kaito-<i>sama</i> sure said some foul remarks!

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.900
What happened with that investigation on the Barians?!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.110
And... I thought the Barians already left Heartland...

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:02.510
Oh! Wh-What is up with this paper?!

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:14.770
D-Damn that wastepaper!

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:19.140
<i>Without you in my heart, I cannot exist.</i>

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.080
<i>You are the meal I need to live!</i>

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.250
<i>The merciful rain that parches the soil!</i>

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.420
<i>That is you.</i>

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:31.340
<i>I am in love with you.</i>

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.110
*Kaboom!*

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:35.950
<i>- Throughout the entire world...</i>
 - Huh?

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.070
Was that static electricity that caused my body to shiver just now?

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:43.140
<i>"The Song of Love" Film - Coming in March.</i>

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.580
What in the world <i>is</i> this?!

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.840
Everyone here is flirting! Flirting!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.000
<i>Meow!</i>

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:57.470
I'm busy fulfilling Kaito-<i>sama</i>'s orders, and he's waiting!

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:00.110
Hmph! How silly!

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.880
Ow, ow, ow...

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:13.050
Darn you! That really hurt!

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.310
You big idiot! Where do you think...

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:33.110
Um...

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:38.380
Big idiot! <i>You</i> big idiot!

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.500
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:02:55.500 --> 00:03:01.470
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:04.180
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:16.530
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:19.610
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:24.120
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.490
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.710
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:34.250
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.380
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.090
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:41.550
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.600
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:47.060
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:53.100
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.860
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.320
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:02.030
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:11.080
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:33.830
"Operation: Save Obomi!?
 I, a Lover, am Invincible!"

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.710
No, I mustn't!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.300
What in the world is this?!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:50.310
This IC circuit-like noise erupting within me?!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:53.680
It's un-parsable, un-parsable! I can't parse this!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.600
<i>Without...</i>

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.900
<i>...you in my heart...</i>

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:59.650
<i>...you in my heart, I cannot exist.</i>

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.690
Orbital! Orbital!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.650
What about the Barian's data? Orbital!

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.610
Orbital 7!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.580
Y-Yes, Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.830
What about the data on the investigation of Barian?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:17.000
Y-Yes! Without you in my heart, I cann-
 I mean, no!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.540
Will you stop daydreaming already?

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.000
A-Affirmative!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.720
I simply cannot focus!

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:48.870
<i>Without you in my heart, I cannot exist.</i>

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.830
<i>The merciful rain! That is you!</i>

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.870
<i>I am in love with you.</i>

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:02.800
Love! I have fallen in love!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.760
And what might your name be?

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:06.760
Oboe?

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.550
Oboyo?

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:08.510
Obomi?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:12.310
No, no, no! No way is her name that unsophisticated!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.810
It'd be something like Aidorian!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.640
Oh, I want to meet my Aidorian!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.650
Shopping. In hurry. Returning.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.450
Y-You are...

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.070
Please wait!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:35.410
Huh? This is something you dropped...

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.960
"H-e-l-p me". My word!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.880
Just what is going on here?!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:49.970
This is that fool's house! It couldn't be...

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.890
Hey, go get me some juice!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.980
Y-Yes, Yuma-<i>sama</i>. Right away.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.980
Idiot! This ain't juice! It's <i>tomato juice</i>!

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:06.190
Darn you!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.570
Go get me some food!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:13.370
So when you said, "H-e-l-p me", this is what you meant?!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:18.080
Damn you, Yuma Tsukumo! You shall not be forgiven!

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.330
I am home. I am home.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.290
Welcome home.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.340
You did good work.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.510
Bought h-e-l-p me (ta-su-ke-te).

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:29.840
Let's see...

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.510
Eggs... ("Ta"mago)

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:33.680
Vinegar... ("Su")

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.510
Ketchup... ("Ke"tchup)

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:40.690
Tempura powder. ("Te"mpurakoto)

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:43.100
Thank you. You did a great job.

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:47.820
You really <i>did</i> help us out, Obomi-<i>chan</i>!
 Unlike some <i>other</i> idiot...

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:51.150
Boy am I starving! Is the food ready yet?

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.950
Let's eat right away.

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:55.660
Idiot helps, too.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:59.250
Cursed Yuma Tsukumo...

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:03.710
That fool's a bungling jerk and a complete pushover when it comes to Duels.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:08.210
But he's got the unidentified and unknown identity called Astral attached to him.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:11.880
One must pay close attention to these things.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:18.560
Heck yeah! It's Duel Time!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:19.850
Yes! I'll go with you.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:20.850
Yuma Tsukumo!

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.900
Orbital?!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.650
What are you doing?

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:30.150
I came here to deliver this to you.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.610
Huh? This is...

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.360
"Letter of Challenge" ("Hatashijou")

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.360
"Candy"...? ("Okashijou")

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:41.080
<i>No</i>! It's read as "Letter of Challenge", you darn fool!

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.580
Huh?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.290
I challenge you to a Duel!

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.630
Wha-?

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:49.880
If I win, you will set your O-Bot free!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.510
Huh? You talking about Obomi?

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:57.720
So her name is Obomi-<i>san</i>, is it?
 What a pretty name!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:01.600
I-I'll be setting Obomi-<i>san</i> free! Understand?!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.930
No, I don't get it at all.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.480
Yes, you better make yourself understand,

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:10.270
because I am Dueling you with Obomi-<i>san</i> at stake!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.450
Hey!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.490
Sorry to keep you waiting, Orbital!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.910
O-Obomi-<i>san</i>!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:28.670
I am going to save you from that position right now!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:34.720
Foolma! This will be your end! Now let's do this!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.130
Sounds fun! Let's get to it!

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:43.970
Yuma, it seems that a Duel is about to begin.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:46.310
Yup.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:47.900
Here I go!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.820
Duel Disk, set!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.450
D-Gazer, set!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.570
<i>AR Vision: Link established.</i>

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:01.830
Duel!!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.620
I will be taking the first turn!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.580
My turn! Draw!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:11.540
I activate the Field Magic, Robopark!

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:19.680
This will be the field which we fight on!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:24.850
Then I Summon Super-Defense Robo Lio!

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.480
Then the effect of the Field Magic, Robopark, activates!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:39.070
As per its effect, a player who
 Summons a Machine-Type Monster

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:45.450
can Special Summon a "Super-Defense Robo"
 Monster from their hand!

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:46.660
Come out!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.420
Super Defense Robo Elephan!

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.050
Whoa! That robot's cool!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.510
A Level Eight Monster...

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.140
Yuma, this is not the time to be impressed!

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:04.510
Men really like their robots, huh...?

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.060
Well, of course they do!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.060
Robots light the fire of a man's heart!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.600
It is still too early to be surprised!

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:18.940
When Super-Defense Lio is on the field
 with another Super-Defense Robo,

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:21.320
its level can be doubled!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:28.160
He gathered two Level Eight Monsters in a single turn...

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.290
Here it comes, Yuma!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.330
R-Right!

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:35.130
I Overlay the Level Eight Robo Leo and Robo Elephan!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:40.420
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.130
Xyz Summon!

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.890
The Galaxy that shines within the Darkness,

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.890
Become the Light of Hope and obey me as my servant!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.600
The embodiment of rubble will now descend!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.860
Show yourself, Garbage-Eyes Fat Dragon!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.190
3000 Attack Points?!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.660
Now, Yuma, can you kneel down before me now?!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.960
Hmph, they're so surprised they can't even talk!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.590
No... What the heck is with that piece of junk?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:24.130
H-How rude! Don't judge a book by its cover!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:26.640
I-I now end my turn!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.100
Okay, then here I go!

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.810
My turn! Draw!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.900
I Summon Achacha Archer!

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.740
When Achacha Archer is Summoned successfully,

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:45.200
the opposing player takes 500 points of damage!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:58.290
Then, by reducing the Attack Power of one Xyz Monster on the opponent's field,

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.460
I Special Summon Pakubug!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.590
Wh-What?!

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:07.260
I Overlay my Level Three Achacha Archer and Pakubug!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.310
I use these three Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.600
Xyz Summon!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:18.650
Engrave the rhythm! Muzumuzu Rhythm the String Djinn!

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:28.030
Hmph! What can you do with that Attack Power?

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:31.910
I'm not done! When Muzumuzu Rythm 
battles with an Xyz Monster,

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.710
I can detach one Overlay Unit

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:38.790
and double his Attack Power until the end of this battle!

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:44.670
Go, Muzumuzu Rhythm! Attack the Garbage-Eyes!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.930
Rhythmic String!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.430
S-Say what?!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.730
Heck yeah! I end my turn with that!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:02.480
And Muzumuzu Rythm's Attack Power returns to normal!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:08.780
As I thought, it only looks like a piece of junk!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.240
I feel a bit bad for him.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.160
Obomi-<i>san</i>, please watch me.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:21.710
I will definitely defeat Foolma and rescue you from his clutches!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.630
My turn! Draw!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:28.340
I activate the Magic Card, Garbage Collection!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:32.970
By Banishing two Machine-Type Monsters from my Graveyard,

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:37.140
I can Special Summon one
 Machine-Type Xyz Monster from my Graveyard!

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.140
What?!

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.860
Revive! Garbage-Eyes Fat Dragon!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:57.200
Then I Summon Super-Defense Robo Monke!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.120
When I Summon a Machine-Type Monster,

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:03.630
the effect of the Field Magic, Robopark, activates once again!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:09.340
I can Special Summon another Super-Defense Robo Monke!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.470
Thanks to the effect of Super-Defense Robo Monke,

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:18.390
it can become Garbage-Eyes' Overlay Units!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.350
What?!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.150
The real match begins here!

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:24.060
I activate Garbage-Eyes' effect!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:27.190
When this Monster is Special Summoned from the Graveyard,

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:32.030
I detach one Overlay Unit 
to increase its Attack Power by 1000 points!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:37.080
I detach two to increase its Attack Power by 2000!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.630
5000 Attack Points?!

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.210
This isn't good, Yuma!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:49.840
Garbage-Eyes, attack Muzumuzu Rhythm!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:54.260
Garbage Fat Stream of Aspiration!

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:08.610
Learn your lesson yet, Foolma?
 As Garbage-Eyes' name suggests,

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:12.570
It rises from the Graveyard to slaughter its enemies!
 That regeneration ability is what

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.200
brings out its true power!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.200
I will now end my turn with that!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.540
So his plan was for us to destroy it the first time.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:25.710
Yeah! My turn! Draw!

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.590
I Summon Crane Crane!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.260
I activate Crane Crane's effect!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:39.520
I can Special Summon one Level Three from my Graveyard!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:43.270
I Special Summon Achacha Archer!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:50.650
When Achacha Archer is Special Summoned, it inflicts 500 damage to the opponent!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.910
But I negate this effect

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.540
in order to Special Summon Achacha Chanbara!

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:07.250
When I use this effect to Special Summon Achacha Chanbara,

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.960
I can inflict 400 points of damage onto my opponent!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:15.260
A mere 400 points of damage
 is nothing more than a fart!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.840
Nice work, Yuma!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.970
Yuma, you suck.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.890
Huh? Obomi-<i>san</i>?

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:24.690
I-I get it! You're rooting for me!

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.520
I will certainly answer to your feelings!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.860
Hurry and win, Foolma.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.820
Then, when I have a Level Three Monster on my field,

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:37.070
I can Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.450
Come, Mimimic!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:46.040
I Overlay the Level Three Achacha Archer and Achacha Chanbara!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:50.130
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.000
Xyz Summon!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:56.760
Ring out, Tenten Tempo the Percussion Djinn!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:04.310
And I'll then Overlay the same
 Level Three Mimimic and Crane Crane!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:08.230
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.110
Xyz Summon!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:15.110
Play out, melody! Mellowmellow Melody the Brass Djinn!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:19.160
And I then activate the Magic Card, Reborn March!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.660
When I control a Djinn Monster on my field,

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:27.210
I can Special Summon a Djinn Monster from my Graveyard!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.830
Be reborn! Muzumuzu Rhythm the String Djinn!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.970
He played three musical Monsters!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.090
But Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:44.600
How is he gonna beat the 5000 
Attack Power Garbage-Eyes with them?

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:45.890
Yuma!

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:47.770
Right!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:52.230
I activate the Magic Card, Djinn Orchestra!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:56.820
During this turn, this card makes the opponent's Monsters loses Attack Power

00:18:56.820 --> 00:19:00.200
equal to the total Attack Power of Djinn Monsters on my field!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:01.200
What?!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:06.160
The total Attack Power of my Djinn Monsters is 4600!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:09.540
Play out, Djinn Orchestra!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:24.050
Now Garbage-Eyes' Attack Power is 400!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.430
Gah! Garbage-Eyes!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.560
Get ready, Yuma!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:32.350
Yeah!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:36.860
Go, my Djinns! Attack Garbage-Eyes!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.490
Melody Sound!

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:46.700
I-Impossible...! Garbage-Eyes!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.250
Melody Wave!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:57.750
And this ends it! Rhythmic String!

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.640
Heck yeah!

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:12.140
By the way, Yuma, what exactly was this Duel for?

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:15.940
Beats me... But he's a pretty good Duelist.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:19.230
Hey, let's do it again some time, Orbital!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:22.030
Kekkekke... Cursed Foolma...

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:26.950
I thought this may happen, so I prepared my secret weapon.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.660
Authorizing the launch of Orbital Gun! Now eat this!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.080
Yuma, you suck without your food!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.380
Obomi-<i>san</i>!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:42.760
NOOO!

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:59.520
Eh!? A misunderstanding?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.150
Why would I abuse Obomi?!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:06.280
Yuma sucks and is a mega idiot.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.580
Hey, that was too much!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.040
But he is kind.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:15.080
So Orbital 7 Dueled Yuma-<i>kun</i> for Obomi-<i>chan</i>'s sake.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.540
Huh?

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.170
Huh? Could it be that Orbital...

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.710
...is in love with Obomi-<i>chan</i>?

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:23.630
Wh-What's with that all of a sudden?

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:24.880
Huh?

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:30.640
But in times like this, you need to start out as friends.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.470
I'm telling you... You're wrong...

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:35.940
Here!

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.100
Nice to meet you.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.570
Ahh, I most humbly accept at once!

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:51.120
Where have you been wandering off to?

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.290
K-K-K-Kaiito-<i>sama</i>!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:58.790
- I-I'm so sorry! I'll get started on the report right awa-

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.790
- Your Dueling is still considerably soft.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:21:59.630
Eh?

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.590
Oh... Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:08.550
I feel important!

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:24.400
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:32.080
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:39.670
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:47.010
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.550 --> 00:23:03.940
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:08.740
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:19.080
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:27.630
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:32.430
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:38.730
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:43.440
Rio challenged Shark to a Duel!

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:46.940
They're both always looking happy and their relationship is incomparable to others!

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:48.780
So what in the world happened?!

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:50.990
Wh-What are you saying, Tetsuo?!

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:53.990
If you like her that much, why not attack her with all your feelings?!

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:56.620
This game has become quite intriguing indeed.

00:23:56.700 --> 00:23:59.370
He fused together Black Ray Lancer and Aero Shark?!

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:01.830
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:04.920
"Shark VS Rio: The 100th Dueling Squabble!!"

00:24:05.250 --> 00:24:08.420
I don't want either of them to lose! What an amazing battle!
